└  Your ChatJS app is ready!

Next steps:

  1. cd .local-research/full319
  2. Copy .env.example to .env.local and fill in the values below
  3. bun install
  4. bun run db:push
  5. bun run dev

Required for your configuration:

  * AUTH_SECRET - Secret used to sign auth sessions
  * DATABASE_URL - Database connection string
  * One of:
    * AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY - Vercel AI Gateway API key
    * VERCEL_OIDC_TOKEN - OIDC token available in Vercel runtime
  * AUTH_GITHUB_ID + AUTH_GITHUB_SECRET - GitHub OAuth client id, GitHub OAuth client secret

  For detailed setup instructions, visit https://www.chatjs.dev/docs/quickstart
